<main class="bs">
<section class="bsw bsh"><div><div class="bse">Battery service</div><h1 class="bst">Car battery service & replacement near you</h1><p class="bsc">A reliable battery helps your vehicle start and keeps its electrical systems running. We test your battery and charging system, explain the results clearly, and install the right replacement when it is needed.</p><a class="bsb" href="#battery-book">Request an appointment →</a></div><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-67.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Technician testing a vehicle battery"></section>
<section class="bss bsa"><div class="bsw g2"><article class="bp"><div class="bse">Signs to watch for</div><h3>Signs it may be time for battery service</h3><p>A battery can weaken gradually. Testing is the easiest way to avoid an unexpected no-start.</p><ul class="bl"><li>Vehicle is slow to start</li><li>Battery warning light is on</li><li>Interior or headlights dim</li><li>Battery is more than three years old</li></ul></article><article class="bp"><div class="bse">What’s included</div><h3>What’s included in battery service?</h3><p>We inspect the system that starts and charges your vehicle before recommending service.</p><ul class="bl"><li>Battery and terminal condition check</li><li>Battery load and charging-system test</li><li>Correct replacement battery matched to your vehicle</li><li>Old-battery disposal with a new battery installation</li></ul></article></div></section>
<section class="bss bsd"><div class="bsw center"><div class="bse">Good to know</div><h2 class="bst">Battery service — how often, how long, and what it costs</h2><p class="bsc">Battery condition depends on age, heat, driving habits, and the charging system. A quick test identifies whether your battery still has reliable starting power.</p><div class="g3" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="bp"><h3>Annual testing</h3><p>Test before failure turns a simple replacement into an inconvenient no-start.</p></article><article class="bp"><h3>Same-day service</h3><p>Many battery concerns can be diagnosed and resolved in one visit.</p></article><article class="bp"><h3>Clear answers</h3><p>We test the battery and charging system so you know what needs attention.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="bss"><div class="bsw center"><div class="bse">How booking works</div><h2 class="bst">From request to back on the road</h2><div class="g4" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="bp step"><b>1</b><h3>Request online</h3><p>Choose a nearby store.</p></article><article class="bp step"><b>2</b><h3>Check in</h3><p>Tell us what you have noticed.</p></article><article class="bp step"><b>3</b><h3>Test & diagnose</h3><p>We inspect the battery and charging system.</p></article><article class="bp step"><b>4</b><h3>Back on the road</h3><p>Get a clear service summary and next steps.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="bss bsa"><div class="bsw split"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-67.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Battery service at American Tire Stores"><div><div class="bse">Why it matters</div><h2 class="bst">Why battery service matters</h2><p class="bsc">Heat, short drives, and age slowly reduce battery performance. A simple test helps you plan service before you are left stranded.</p><ul class="bl"><li>Reduces the risk of an unexpected no-start</li><li>Checks charging-system health</li><li>Helps protect electrical-system reliability</li><li>Confirms the correct battery for your vehicle</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="bss"><div class="bsw center"><div class="bse">What a test reveals</div><h2 class="bst">What shortens battery life — and what a test reveals</h2><p class="bsc">A battery test helps distinguish normal aging from charging and electrical concerns.</p><div class="g4" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="bp"><h3>Heat</h3><p>High temperatures accelerate battery wear in Southern California.</p></article><article class="bp"><h3>Short trips</h3><p>Frequent short drives may not fully recharge the battery.</p></article><article class="bp"><h3>Age</h3><p>Performance gradually declines as a battery reaches the end of its service life.</p></article><article class="bp"><h3>Charging system</h3><p>A charging issue can create symptoms similar to a weak battery.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="bss bsd"><div class="bsw center"><div class="bse">Quality you can trust</div><h2 class="bst">Quality batteries, tested and installed right</h2><p class="bsc">We recommend a replacement only when testing shows it is needed, then install a battery suited to your vehicle.</p><div class="g3" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="bp"><h3>Test first</h3><p>Diagnosis comes before replacement recommendations.</p></article><article class="bp"><h3>Vehicle-matched battery</h3><p>The correct battery is selected for your vehicle’s requirements.</p></article><article class="bp"><h3>Installed with care</h3><p>Connections are inspected and the old battery is disposed of responsibly.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="bss bsa"><div class="bsw split"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-67.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Customer discussing battery service"><div><div class="bse">Straightforward options</div><h2 class="bst">What does battery service cost?</h2><p class="bsc">Pricing varies with your vehicle and battery requirements. Select a location to request service and your advisor can confirm the best option. Financing is available for qualifying customers.</p><a class="bsb" href="/pages/financing">Explore financing →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="bss bsd" id="battery-book"><div class="bsw center"><div class="bse">Request an appointment</div><h2 class="bst">Book battery service at your store</h2><p class="bsc">Choose your nearest American Tire Stores location to begin your battery-service request.</p><div class="book"><div class="brow"><select id="battery-store" aria-label="Choose a store"><option value="">Choose your store</option><option value="52820">Ventura</option><option value="52819">Thousand Oaks</option><option value="52819">Valencia</option><option value="61758">Hollywood</option><option value="52816">Glendale</option><option value="52818">Glendale 2</option><option value="52814">Bellflower</option><option value="52814">Costa Mesa</option><option value="52815">Cathedral City</option></select><button type="button" class="bsb" onclick="window.startBatteryBooking()">Request battery service →</button></div><div id="battery-widget" class="widget">Choose a store above to begin your battery-service request.</div></div></div></section>
<section class="bss"><div class="bsw center"><div class="bse">Why American Tire Stores</div><h2 class="bst">Service Southern California drivers trust</h2><div class="g3" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="bp"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“They tested the battery, explained the results, and had me back on the road quickly.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article><article class="bp"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“The service was straightforward and I appreciated that they checked the charging system too.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article><article class="bp"><div class="stars">★★★★★</div><p>“Easy appointment, clear advice, and a fast replacement when my battery needed it.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article></div></div></section>
<section class="bss bsa"><div class="bsw center"><div class="bse">Near you</div><h2 class="bst">Battery service near you, across Southern California</h2><p class="bsc">Battery testing and replacement are available at all American Tire Stores locations.</p><div class="locs"><article class="loc"><h3>Ventura</h3><p>5100 Telegraph Rd<br>(805) 644-3330</p><a href="/pages/location-ventura-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Thousand Oaks</h3><p>621 E Thousand Oaks Blvd<br>(805) 379-1910</p><a href="/pages/location-thousand-oaks-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Valencia</h3><p>23510 Valencia Blvd, Unit A<br>(661) 596-1444</p><a href="/pages/location-valencia-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Hollywood</h3><p>1174 N Western Ave<br>(323) 372-9372</p><a href="/pages/location-hollywood-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Glendale</h3><p>737 S Glendale Ave<br>(818) 243-3191</p><a href="/pages/location-glendale-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Glendale 2</h3><p>1130 S Central Ave<br>(818) 547-2010</p><a href="/pages/location-glendale-ii-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Bellflower</h3><p>9509 Alondra Blvd<br>(562) 804-4737</p><a href="/pages/location-bellflower-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Costa Mesa</h3><p>2049 Harbor Blvd<br>(949) 802-6419</p><a href="/pages/location-costa-mesa-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="loc"><h3>Cathedral City</h3><p>68406 E Palm Canyon Dr<br>(760) 469-9510</p><a href="/pages/location-cathedral-city-ca">Store details →</a></article></div></div></section>
<section class="bss"><div class="bsw center"><div class="bse">More services</div><h2 class="bst">Related auto services</h2><div class="g3 related" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="bp"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-66.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Tire installation"><div class="body"><h3>Tire installation</h3><p>Professional installation for tires that fit your vehicle.</p><a href="/pages/service-tire-installation">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="bp"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-64.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Wheel alignment"><div class="body"><h3>Wheel alignment</h3><p>Support even tire wear and stable steering.</p><a href="/pages/service-wheel-alignment">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="bp"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-65.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Brake service"><div class="body"><h3>Brake service</h3><p>Keep your braking system ready for the road.</p><a href="/pages/service-brake-repair">Learn more →</a></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="bss bsa"><div class="bsw center"><div class="bse">Good to know</div><h2 class="bst">Battery service FAQ</h2><div class="faq"><details><summary>How long does a car battery last?</summary><p>Many batteries last about three to five years, but climate, driving habits, and the charging system all affect battery life.</p></details><details><summary>What are the signs of a failing car battery?</summary><p>Slow starting, dim lights, a battery warning light, and an older battery are common signs that a test is worthwhile.</p></details><details><summary>Can you test my battery?</summary><p>Yes. We can test your battery and charging system to help identify the cause of a starting or electrical concern.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need an appointment?</summary><p>An appointment is recommended so the store can reserve time and confirm availability.</p></details><details><summary>Do you dispose of the old battery?</summary><p>Yes. When we install a replacement battery, the old battery is handled through responsible disposal and recycling procedures.</p></details></div></div></section>
<section class="final"><div class="bsw"><div class="bse">Reliable starts begin here</div><h2 class="bst">Ready for battery service?</h2><p class="bsc">Request an appointment at your nearest American Tire Stores location today.</p><a class="bsb" href="#battery-book">Request an appointment →</a></div></section>
